    "summary": "The §9.1 AEAD invocation as data: the exact AAD bytes and nonce in both directions, envelopes at counters zero and one in both directions, a control record taking the next pair of the same directional sequence, and the four tampering cases — a header byte of each field, a ciphertext byte, an AEAD tag byte, the direction label, and `sessionBindingHash`.",
